<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (Interfaith engagement must also move beyond dialogue towards collaboration. When communities come together to feed the hungry, care for the vulnerable, protect the environment, support young people and respond to human suffering, they discover the transformative power of shared service. Such initiatives demonstrate that our common humanity is not merely a philosophical concept; it is a responsibility that we can fulfil together. They also create lasting relationships of trust that can help communities withstand moments of tension and uncertainty.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
