/E (The Act imposes additional procedural requirements on anyone wishing to change their religion. These include need for advance notice, mandatory declarations and post-conversion reporting. A matter of individual conscience between a person and God thus becomes a regulated activity, potentially exposing citizens to public disclosure, social pressure and possible harassment from private groups.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [16]
>>
