/E (A common perception is that the Act largely impacts only the minorities but in reality it impacts all religions by affecting voluntary choice of individuals. In particular the Act disproportionately affects women, young adults, Dalits and Adivasis. It may undermine the autonomy and dignity of women and appears to proceed on the assumption that women lack agency of their own and that people from SC and ST communities are being converted on a mass scale through deceit, a claim for which no evidence has been presented. Prominent leaders from the Community have already opposed the Act and Prakash Ambedkar of the Vanchit Bahujan Aghadi has announced a Bombay High Court challenge)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
